). b. of God , קָדְשִׁי לְשֵׁם Ezek 39:25 , לְאַרְצוֺ Joel 2:18 , ׳לִירוּשׁ Zech 1:14 , לְצִיּוֺן 8:2 (twice in verse). 4 excite to jealous anger , with בִּ instrumental Deut 32:21 a (dubious; probably הַקְנִאוּנִי ; compare 32:16 .21 b), 1Kin 14:22 . Hiph`il provoke to jealous anger: Imperfect 3masculine plural suffix יַקְנִאֻהוּ Deut 32:16 ; יַקְנִיאוּהוּ Psa 78:58 (|| וַיַּכְעִיסוּהוּ ) 1 singular אַקְנִיאֵם Deut 32:21 b; Participle metaplastic מַקְנֶה Ezek 8:3 (Ges § 75q , del Co.).","rootNote":"a primitive root;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Kgs 14 22","keyReferences":["1Kgs 14 22","1Kgs 19 10","1Kgs 19 10","1Kgs 19 14","1Kgs 19 14","2Sam 21 2","Deut 32 16","Deut 32 21"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":33,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Kgs 14 22","book":"1Kgs","chapter":14,"verse":22,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/יְקַנְא֣וּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vpw3mp"},{"reference":"1Kgs 19 10","book":"1Kgs","chapter":19,"verse":10,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"קַנֹּ֨א","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVpa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 19 10","book":"1Kgs","chapter":19,"verse":10,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"קִנֵּ֜אתִי","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVpp1cs"},{"reference":"1Kgs 19 14","book":"1Kgs","chapter":19,"verse":14,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"קַנֹּ֨א","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVpa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 19 14","book":"1Kgs","chapter":19,"verse":14,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"קִנֵּ֜אתִי","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVpp1cs"},{"reference":"2Sam 21 2","book":"2Sam","chapter":21,"verse":2,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְּ/קַנֹּאת֥/וֹ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Vpc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"Deut 32 16","book":"Deut","chapter":32,"verse":16,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יַקְנִאֻ֖/הוּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVhi3mp/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"Deut 32 21","book":"Deut","chapter":32,"verse":21,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"קִנְא֣וּ/נִי","source":"hebrew","mo